    "sentence_translations": [
      "Did You Do It for Nothing?",
      "",
      "A lot of people really like the color white. They feel that it’s both simple and clean.",
      "There are also people who say that a child is a blank piece of paper because there is nothing on it.",
      "The character “bai” also has another meaning in Chinese, let’s take a look!",
      "",
      "If you miss your friend, and you go to their house to hang out, but the friend isn’t at home, ..",
      ".. then we can say, “He isn’t at home. I came for nothing.”",
      "If you go to a restaurant where you like to eat, but you find that it’s closed, ..",
      ".. then you can say, “I didn’t get to eat the food I wanted. I came for nothing.”",
      "Both of these times, the character “bai” means ”useless”.",
      "",
      "In life and work, we will often “do many things for nothing”, making us feel very worn out and unhappy.",
      "But there are also those who say, that there is no such thing as “doing something for nothing”.",
      "The result comes in the future. What do you think?",
      ""
